('xiaomi-electric-scooter-5-ultra', 'Xiaomi Electric Scooter 5 Ultra 48V 30km Range - Onyx Black', 'e-mobility', 320000, 315000, 268000, 8, 17.5, '/assets/products/xiaomi-scooter-5-ultra.jpg', 'Navigate Nigerian traffic with zero emissions. The Scooter 5 Ultra features a powerful 500W motor, dual suspension for rough roads, 10-inch self-sealing tires, and a 30km range on a single charge. Folds in 3 seconds for bus or car trunk storage.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 268000, '/assets/products/xiaomi-scooter-5-ultra.jpg', 298000, 4.6, 1, 'Xiaomi', 1, 1),

