('renogy-200w-solar-suitcase', 'Renogy 200W 12V Foldable Solar Panel Suitcase with Controller', 'solar', 250000, 245000, 215000, 6, 15.5, '/assets/products/renogy-200w-suitcase.jpg', 'Portable solar power that unfolds in seconds. The 200W monocrystalline suitcase features a built-in 20A Voyager charge controller with LCD display, adjustable kickstands for optimal sun angle, and a rugged carrying case for camping and emergency backup.', 1, unixepoch('2026-06-16'), 1, 215000, '/assets/products/renogy-200w-suitcase.jpg', 235000, 4.6, 1, 'Renogy', 1, 1),

